@startuml CharacterScreen_Architecture
' 角色面板架构图：沿用项目 UI 框架的 View / Controller / 展示 Model 分层。
' Buff 数据来自 UCC_BuffComponent 的复制快照，显示信息来自 GE 上的 UCC_BuffUIData。
' 灰 = 已有 UI 框架；绿 = 已有 GAS / Buff 系统；蓝 = 本次新增 C++；橙 = 由你在编辑器中制作的 WBP。

skinparam defaultFontName "Noto Sans CJK SC"
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam nodesep 40
skinparam ranksep 60
skinparam class {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #555555
  ArrowColor #444444
}
skinparam class<<Framework>> {
  BackgroundColor #EEEEEE
  BorderColor #888888
}
skinparam class<<New>> {
  BackgroundColor #E3EDFC
  BorderColor #3B6FD1
}
skinparam class<<Blueprint>> {
  BackgroundColor #FCEBDC
  BorderColor #C76A1C
}
skinparam class<<Existing>> {
  BackgroundColor #E6F4EA
  BorderColor #3D8B55
}

title 角色面板 · 架构图（基于 ui/framework-review-fixes 的 Buff 系统）

package "UI 框架（已有）" {
  class UCC_RootLayout <<Framework>> {
    + ShowScreen(Layer, ScreenClass, Context)
    + CloseScreen(Screen)
  }
  abstract class UCC_ActivatableWidget <<Framework>> {
    # ControllerClass
    + PrepareForDisplay(Context)
    + GetUIModel()
    + CloseScreen()
    # NativeOnActivated()
    # NativeOnDeactivated()
    # NativeOnModelChanged()
  }
  class UCC_UIController <<Framework>> {
    # ModelClass
    + Activate() / Deactivate() / Release()
    + GetPlayerController()
    # OnActivated()
    # OnDeactivated()
  }
  class UCC_UIModel <<Framework>> {
    + OnChanged
    # NotifyChanged()
  }
  class FCC_PlayerVitals <<Framework>> <<struct>> {
    Health / MaxHealth
    Mana / MaxMana
    GetHealthPercent() / GetManaPercent()
  }
}

package "角色面板 · View" {
  abstract class UCC_CharacterScreenWidget <<New>> {
    # BuffList : UPanelWidget <<BindWidgetOptional>>
    # BuffEntryClass
    - EntriesById : TMap<int32, Entry>
    - SeenStatsRevision / SeenBuffsRevision
    + GetBuffRemainingTime(Buff) : float
    # NativeOnActivated()
    # NativeOnModelChanged()
    # <<BP Event>> OnStatsChanged(Name, Vitals, Stats)
    # <<BP Event>> OnBuffsChanged(Buffs)
    - SyncBuffList(Buffs)
  }
  abstract class UCC_CharacterBuffEntryWidget <<New>> {
    # Icon / NameText / DescriptionText <<BindWidgetOptional>>
    # TimeText / TimeBar <<BindWidgetOptional>>
    # NameWithStacksFormat / InfiniteDurationText
    + SetBuff(Buff)
    + GetRemainingTime() : float
    # NativeTick()
    # <<BP Event>> OnBuffSet(Buff)
  }
}

package "角色面板 · Controller" {
  class UCC_CharacterScreenController <<New>> {
    # DisplayedStats : TArray<FCC_CharacterStatConfig>
    # DebuffTag : FGameplayTag
    - BoundCharacter / BoundASC / BoundBuffs（弱引用）
    - AttributeHandles
    # OnActivated() / OnDeactivated()
    - HandlePawnChanged(Old, New)
    - HandleASCReady(ASC, AttributeSet)
    - BindASC() / BindBuffComponent() / UnbindPawn()
    - HandleAttributeChanged() → RefreshStats()
    - HandleBuffsChanged() → RefreshBuffs()
  }
  class FCC_CharacterStatConfig <<New>> <<struct>> {
    Attribute : FGameplayAttribute
    Label : FText
    Format : Integer / Decimal / Percent
  }
}

package "角色面板 · 展示 Model" {
  class UCC_CharacterScreenModel <<New>> {
    - DisplayName : FText
    - Vitals : FCC_PlayerVitals
    - Stats : TArray<FCC_CharacterStatEntry>
    - Buffs : TArray<FCC_CharacterBuffEntry>
    - StatsRevision / BuffsRevision
    + GetDisplayName() / GetVitals()
    + GetStats() / GetBuffs()
    - SetStats(Name, Vitals, Stats)
    - SetBuffs(Buffs)
  }
  class FCC_CharacterStatEntry <<New>> <<struct>> {
    Attribute / Label
    Value : float
    ValueText : FText（已格式化）
  }
  class FCC_CharacterBuffEntry <<New>> <<struct>> {
    InstanceId : int32
    EffectClass
    DisplayName / Description / Icon
    StackCount / Level
    bIsDebuff / bIsInhibited
    Duration / EndServerTime
    BuffTags
  }
}

package "GAS 与 Buff 系统（已有）" {
  class ACC_BaseCharacter <<Existing>> {
    OnASCInitialized
    GetBuffComponent()
  }
  class UAbilitySystemComponent <<Existing>> {
    GetGameplayAttributeValueChangeDelegate()
    GetNumericAttribute()
  }
  class UCC_AttributeSet <<Existing>> {
    Health / MaxHealth / Mana / MaxMana
    AttackPower / Defense
    CriticalChance / CriticalMultiplier
    MoveSpeedMultiplier …
  }
  class UCC_BuffComponent <<Existing>> {
    + OnBuffsChanged
    + GetActiveBuffs() : TArray<FCC_ReplicatedBuffItem>
    - ReplicatedBuffs : FastArray
  }
  class FCC_ReplicatedBuffItem <<Existing>> <<struct>> {
    InstanceId / EffectClass / BuffTags
    StackCount / Level / bIsInhibited
    Duration / EndServerTime
  }
  class UCC_BuffUIData <<Existing>> {
    DisplayName / Description / Icon
    bHiddenInUI
  }
}

package "UE 编辑器（由你负责）" {
  class WBP_CharacterScreen <<Blueprint>> {
    左侧：名字、血蓝、属性列表
    右侧：BuffList 容器
    实现 OnStatsChanged
  }
  class WBP_CharacterBuffEntry <<Blueprint>> {
    Icon / NameText / DescriptionText
    TimeText / TimeBar
    实现 OnBuffSet（配色、半透明）
  }
}

' ---- 继承 ----
UCC_ActivatableWidget <|-- UCC_CharacterScreenWidget
UCC_UIController <|-- UCC_CharacterScreenController
UCC_UIModel <|-- UCC_CharacterScreenModel
UCC_CharacterScreenWidget <|-- WBP_CharacterScreen
UCC_CharacterBuffEntryWidget <|-- WBP_CharacterBuffEntry

' ---- 所有权与引用 ----
UCC_RootLayout --> UCC_ActivatableWidget : ShowScreen(UI.Layer.GameMenu)
UCC_CharacterScreenWidget *-- UCC_CharacterScreenController : 强引用\n每次入栈新建
UCC_CharacterScreenController *-- UCC_CharacterScreenModel : 强引用
UCC_CharacterScreenController *-- "*" FCC_CharacterStatConfig
UCC_CharacterScreenModel *-- FCC_PlayerVitals
UCC_CharacterScreenModel *-- "*" FCC_CharacterStatEntry
UCC_CharacterScreenModel *-- "*" FCC_CharacterBuffEntry
UCC_CharacterScreenWidget ..> UCC_CharacterScreenModel : 订阅 OnChanged\n只读
UCC_CharacterScreenWidget o-- "*" UCC_CharacterBuffEntryWidget : BuffList 中按 InstanceId 复用

' ---- 数据来源（只读）----
UCC_CharacterScreenController ..> ACC_BaseCharacter : 弱引用
UCC_CharacterScreenController ..> UAbilitySystemComponent : 属性委托（按句柄）
UCC_CharacterScreenController ..> UCC_BuffComponent : OnBuffsChanged\nGetActiveBuffs()
UCC_CharacterScreenController ..> UCC_BuffUIData : EffectClass CDO\nFindComponent
ACC_BaseCharacter *-- UCC_BuffComponent
UAbilitySystemComponent o-- UCC_AttributeSet
UCC_BuffComponent *-- "*" FCC_ReplicatedBuffItem

note right of UCC_BuffComponent
  服务器：ActiveGE 增删、叠层、刷新时长、抑制 → NotifyChanged → OnBuffsChanged
  客户端：FastArray PostReplicatedReceive → OnBuffsChanged
  两端走同一个委托，控制器不区分网络角色。
end note

note bottom of UCC_CharacterBuffEntryWidget
  剩余时间 = EndServerTime − GameState.GetServerWorldTimeSeconds()
  与 CC_BuffBarWidget / BuffComponent::GetRemainingTime 同一算法；
  每帧在条目里算，不进 Model，不触发整页刷新。
end note

note right of UCC_CharacterScreenController
  过滤规则与 CC_BuffBarWidget 一致：
  没有 UCC_BuffUIData 或 bHiddenInUI 的不显示。
  减益判断只看 BuffTags 是否含 DebuffTag，
  不认识任何具体 Buff（CLAUDE.md 规则 1）。
end note

legend left
  |= 颜色 |= 含义 |
  |<#EEEEEE>| 已有 UI 框架 |
  |<#E6F4EA>| 已有 GAS / Buff 系统 |
  |<#E3EDFC>| 本次新增 C++ |
  |<#FCEBDC>| WBP，由你在编辑器中制作 |
endlegend

@enduml
